  "source_brief": {
    "silhouette": "A small broad stance with a large round wooden buckler and an upright leaf-shaped fantasy club. An oversized short scarf forms a clear horizontal at the neck.",
    "face": "Light brown skin, freckled cheeks, bright hazel eyes and dense chestnut curls. Keep the face friendly and visibly adult.",
    "costume": "Apple-green quilted jacket, ochre trousers, a red neck scarf and broad walking boots. Outfit proportions emphasize capable mobility, not toy-like baby features.",
    "palette": "Apple green #7A985A; ochre #BE9A59; berry red #A85251; walnut #73553B.",
    "equipment": "Round orchard-mark buckler and short stylized wooden club reinforced with decorative bronze bands. Both are exaggerated fantasy props.",
    "signature": "Circular buckler, large red scarf and wide planted stance.",
    "materials": "Quilted cloth, matte wood and dull bronze. Paint the orchard emblem in one readable silhouette.",
    "back": "A square travel patch on the jacket and scarf ends over one shoulder keep the rear identifiable.",
    "animation": "Idle is grounded rather than constantly bouncing. Walk uses quick full-foot steps. Basics are short determined swings. Stout Heart lifts the buckler with a compact upward hop that returns to the same logical cell.",
    "vfx": "A small green-gold shield outline that matches her scale. No taunt or healing accompanies it.",
    "audio": "A light wooden knock and short warm chime; avoid childish squeaks.",
    "risk": "Small units can disappear behind tall allies. Test camera spacing and health-bar anchors without enlarging her logical footprint."
  },
  "equipment": "Visual only; fully authored wooden club and buckler weighted to weapon bones",
